==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Finno-Ugric|eðe|lang=fi}}; a cognate of Hungarian {{term|elõ}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈe̞si]}}
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:Finnish:-esi|-esi]]
*Hyphenation: e·si

===Prefix===
{{fi-pref}}

# [[pre-]], [[fore-]].

====Inflection====
*The cases of ''esi-'' serve in Finnish only as adverbs. The instructive singular is always used with the enclitic particle ''[[-kin]]'' or ''[[-kään]]''.
